1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760
I don't need a perfect relationship.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,160
I just want one that feels real and safe.

3
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:10,800
No lies, no cheating, no breaking up over every little fight.

4
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,580
If we argue, we talk it through.

5
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,740
If life gets hard, we face it together.

6
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,820
We don't walk away, we stay.

7
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:22,420
That's the kind of love I want.
